entry.content:
webaz_buy: description, inputSchema  -Several +No pay_with → the way last paid with if offered, else returns the -pay, no pay_with → returns them +choose. user_message is -user to choose. +person.  parameters: +input.reorder_from_order_id input.reorder_from_order_id description: buy an earlier order again (no product_id)
webaz_buyer_orders: description, outputSchema  -(order_id/status/next_actor/deadline/amount/item_ref/payment_rail), +(order_id/status/next_actor/deadline/amount/item_ref/payment_rail/title/variant_label/unit_price/quantity/pay_method),  parameters: -7-key +minimal -minimal 7-key: order_id/status/next_actor/deadline/amount/item_ref/payment_rail +minimal: order_id/status/next_actor/deadline/amount/item_ref/payment_rail/title/variant_label/unit_price/quantity/pay_method (null = unknown)
webaz_quote_order: outputSchema  parameters: -[{rail,account_id?,method_label,payable_units,discount_units,protection}]; +[{rail,account_id?,method_label,payable_units,discount_units,protection,buyer_last_paid?}];

get_billing: description  +plans without those windows (including the trial) are limited by the allowance in dockUsage.monthly;
pull_capability: description  -instead. +if you have that tool; if you don't, ask your owner to sign in for you (they can take over your browser) or to make the login readable in Settings → Vault.
update_html: description  +Reference Dock file images in markup or CSS (src, srcset, url()), not from script.

visarun_check_eligibility: description  -adds), +adds; government_fee_not_included, where present, is a government fee the person pays outside Visarun, so not in amount: to the visa centre, which also takes its own service fee (a Schengen state's consular fee, China's visa fee outside the US), or to the mission (Japan's and Taiwan's consular fees, China's in the US), an adult's amount in its currency, null where the centre or mission sets it),
visarun_get_requirements: description  +For a Schengen state, documentNeeds marks each document required of every applicant or depends, with when naming the situation, from that state's own pages (documentSources says whose list and for which place of application): tell the person which documents everyone brings and which depend on them, and that the consulate where they apply may ask for more.
visarun_list_destinations: description  -app); +app), with government_fee_not_included where the person also pays a government fee outside Visarun, to the visa centre or the mission;
